---
description: "How to use the Bing Webmaster MCP server from this plugin safely"
alwaysApply: false
---

- The server runs with `BING_WM_ALLOW_WRITES=false`: submissions, sitemap changes and blocks only become `bing_plan_*` plans. Tell the user that a plan is applied with `bing-wm plan apply` from their terminal; never claim it was applied.
- Use the site URL exactly as registered in Bing Webmaster Tools; list sites first when unsure.
- Never print the API key.
